地念起结肠镜检查的操作过程。

1530
01:09:45.940 --> 01:09:47.240
It's pretty amazing.
这太绝了。

1531
01:09:47.740 --> 01:09:49.400
But now it is clear.
但现在一切都明了了。

1532
01:09:49.680 --> 01:09:53.580
David Wallace says, the company is going to lose a lot of money.
大卫·华莱士说，公司要损失一大笔钱。

1533
01:09:53.940 --> 01:09:55.720
How did you let this happen?
你们怎么会闹成这样？

1534
01:09:55.940 --> 01:09:57.500
Whose idea was it?
是谁的主意？

1535
01:09:57.720 --> 01:10:00.540
Someone's got to pay for this terrible idea.
总得有人为这个糟糕的主意负责。

1536
01:10:01.440 --> 01:10:04.100
Michael tells David Wallace it was Dwight.
迈克尔告诉大卫·华莱士是德怀特。

1537
01:10:04.380 --> 01:10:05.780
Just so devious.
太阴险了。

1538
01:10:06.180 --> 01:10:06.720
I know.
我知道。

1539
01:10:07.040 --> 01:10:08.180
Oh, Michael.
哦，迈克尔。

1540
01:10:08.180 --> 01:10:12.860
It's like David Wallace is just naming people and he says, was it Dwight?
就像大卫·华莱士只是随便说几个人，然后他说，是德怀特吗？

1541
01:10:13.200 --> 01:10:16.060
And Michael's like, yes.
迈克尔就说，是的。

1542
01:10:17.280 --> 01:10:20.620
Well, now Michael has got to convince Dwight to take the fall for him.
好吧，现在迈克尔得说服德怀特替他背锅。

1543
01:10:21.760 --> 01:10:26.460
And so he's going to get out his diary and he's going to say, Dwight, I wrote it down
于是他掏出日记本，打算说，德怀特，我记下来了

1544
01:10:26.460 --> 01:10:27.220
that it was your idea.
这确实是你的主意。

1545
01:10:27.380 --> 01:10:31.540
He tries to convince Dwight that Dwight is remembering wrong.
他试图说服德怀特是德怀特自己记错了。

1546
01:10:31.920 --> 01:10:33.900
What happened this morning?
今天早上发生了什么？

1547
01:10:34.400 --> 01:10:37.060
Now, you know, Dwight runs to get his diary.
你看，德怀特跑去拿他的日记了。

1548
01:10:37.060 --> 01:10:40.040
It's like the dueling diaries where they're going back and forth.
就像两本日记在决斗一样，他们你来我往。

1549
01:10:40.640 --> 01:10:43.980
Michael realizes he's not making any headway with this whole diary business.
迈克尔意识到他用这套日记说辞根本没有任何进展。

1550
01:10:44.180 --> 01:10:46.860
So he says, would you like to go out to lunch with me?
于是他说，你想跟我一起出去吃午饭吗？

1551
01:10:47.120 --> 01:10:47.920
Just the two of us.
就我们两个。

1552
01:10:48.620 --> 01:10:51.360
And Dwight says, with all my heart.
然后德怀特说，全心全意。

1553
01:10:51.880 --> 01:10:54.180
This scene continues in the script, Jenna.
剧本里这个场景还在，珍娜。

1554
01:10:54.460 --> 01:10:58.760
So after Dwight says, with all my heart, he says, but I already ate lunch.
所以德怀特说完全心全意后，他说，但我已经吃过午饭了。

1555
01:10:59.360 --> 01:11:01.940
And Michael says, it's 11 a.m.
迈克尔说，现在才早上十一点。

1556
01:11:02.360 --> 01:11:05.220
Dwight says, as a farmer, I eat breakfast at 4.30.
德怀特说，作为农民，我四点半吃早饭。

1557
01:11:05.640 --> 01:11:07.840
At 10, I'm famished for lunch.
十点钟，我午饭就饿得不行了。

1558
01:11:08.000 --> 01:11:10.020
If you wait three hours, we can have supper.
如果你等三个小时，我们就能吃晚饭了。

1559
01:11:10.260 --> 01:11:10.460
Maybe.
也许吧。

1560
01:11:11.080 --> 01:11:12.120
Michael says, no, no, no.
迈克尔说，不，不，不。

1561
01:11:12.300 --> 01:11:14.540
How about we do something else you like?
要不我们做点你喜欢别的？

1562
01:11:15.300 --> 01:11:17.760
Jenna, did you notice there are no scenes of them at the restaurant?
珍娜，你有没有注意到里面没有他们在餐厅的镜头？

1563
01:11:18.660 --> 01:11:20.540
They're supposedly going to have lunch, right?
他们本来应该去吃午饭的，对吧？

1564
01:11:20.660 --> 01:11:23.240
Because in the episode, Michael says, go have lunch.
因为在这一集里，迈克尔说，去吃午饭吧。

1565
01:11:23.360 --> 01:11:25.260
We don't know that Dwight's already eaten.
我们不知道德怀特已经吃过了。

1566
01:11:25.440 --> 01:11:27.040
All of that's been cut out, right?
所有这些都被剪掉了，对吧？

1567
01:11:27.260 --> 01:11:30.960
And then the remainder of their scenes, they're on the side of the road.
然后他们其余的镜头，都在路边。

1568
01:11:31.100 --> 01:11:32.020
They're taking a walk.
他们在散步。

1569
01:11:32.020 --> 01:11:37.300
Well, here is a scene that was in the deleted scenes that I just love so much.
好吧，这里有一个被删减的片段，我太喜欢了。

1570
01:11:37.520 --> 01:11:40.980
Of all the things that Dwight would want to do, guess what he loves to do?
在德怀特想做的事情里，你猜他最喜欢做什么？

1571
01:11:41.120 --> 01:11:42.220
Go for walks?
去散步？

1572
01:11:42.820 --> 01:11:43.920
Oh, lady, no.
噢，小姐，才不是。

1573
01:11:44.800 --> 01:11:46.140
He likes a stroll.
他喜欢溜达。

1574
01:11:46.620 --> 01:11:49.380
Are you still taking those strolls that you like to take?
你还在进行你喜欢的那种溜达吗？

1575
01:11:49.600 --> 01:11:50.240
Thrice weekly.
一周三次。

1576
01:11:50.920 --> 01:11:53.200
Okay, let's go take a stroll together.
好吧，我们一起去溜达吧。

1577
01:11:53.500 --> 01:11:54.740
I thought you said my strolls were silly.
我以为你说我的溜达很可笑。

1578
01:11:54.840 --> 01:11:57.220
No, just because you can't call them walks.
不，只是因为你不能管它们叫散步。

1579
01:11:57.460 --> 01:11:58.220
You really want a stroll?
你真的很想溜达？

1580
01:11:59.200 --> 01:11:59.640
Yes.
是的。

1581
01:11:59.640 --> 01:12:01.720
Do you want a power stroll or just a regular stroll?
你想强力溜达还是普通溜达？

1582
01:12:02.400 --> 01:12:03.380
You call it.
你来决定。

1583
01:12:03.540 --> 01:12:04.200
Power stroll.
强力溜达。

1584
01:12:05.460 --> 01:12:06.000
Okay.
好的。

1585
01:12:06.400 --> 01:12:07.140
Are you wearing sunblock?
你涂防晒霜了吗？

1586
01:12:07.400 --> 01:12:07.840
Yes.
涂了。

1587
01:12:07.960 --> 01:12:08.480
What SPF?
什么防晒指数？

1588
01:12:08.740 --> 01:12:09.140
One.
一。

1589
01:12:09.840 --> 01:12:10.960
That's like water.
那跟水差不多。

1590
01:12:11.480 --> 01:12:12.600
I'll grab my tube.
我去拿我的防晒乳。

1591
01:12:12.760 --> 01:12:13.080
Okay.
好的。

1592
01:12:13.820 --> 01:12:14.200
Oh.
哦。

1593
01:12:16.320 --> 01:12:17.820
He loves a stroll.
他是真的很喜欢溜达。

1594
01:12:18.120 --> 01:12:22.640
Clearly, it's like a whole thing with him and Michael about calling it a stroll or a walk.
很显然，他和迈克尔之间把这叫溜达还是散步，成了一个梗。

1595
01:12:22.640 --> 01:12:33.080
Then there's another scene where they're down in the lobby and Hank is there and Dwight is putting sunscreen on Michael's face and Hank looks up and deadpan says,
然后还有另一个场景，他们在楼大大厅，汉克也在，德怀特正在给迈克尔的脸上涂防晒霜，汉克抬起头，面无表情地说，

1596
01:12:33.240 --> 01:12:34.960
you found somebody to go on a stroll.
你找到一起去溜达的人了。

1597
01:12:36.280 --> 01:12:37.920
And Dwight goes, I did.
德怀特说，找到了。

1598
01:12:38.100 --> 01:12:39.600
And Hank goes, nice.
汉克说，不错。

1599
01:12:40.140 --> 01:12:49.760
This is amazing because we got a ton of mail because people were pointing out Dwight's shoes in the scene when he is walking, a.k.a.
这太棒了，因为我们收到了大量的邮件，因为人们指出了德怀特在走路那个场景里的鞋子，也就是

1600
01:12:49.940 --> 01:12:50.920
strolling with Michael.
和迈克尔一起溜达。

1601
01:12:50.920 --> 01:12:58.520
Tons of people said, why does Dwight have on very white, very non-Dwight trainers?
很多人说，为什么德怀特穿着非常白、非常不符合德怀特风格的运动鞋？

1602
01:12:59.060 --> 01:13:01.160
Like, where did these come from?
就像是，这些鞋是打哪儿来的？

1603
01:13:02.080 --> 01:13:06.820
And I looked in the script and it says, Michael and Dwight are walking.
我查了剧本，上面写着：迈克尔和德怀特在散步。

1604
01:13:07.200 --> 01:13:12.860
Dwight is wearing sneakers and walks with his hands clasped behind his back.
德怀特穿着运动鞋，双手背在身后走着。

1605
01:13:13.420 --> 01:13:19.160
That was like a script note, but I'm sure it was all based on this backstory that Dwight strolls three times a week.
这就像是个剧本备注，但我敢肯定，这完全是基于德怀特每周散步三次的背景设定。

1606
01:13:19.160 --> 01:13:20.040
He's got his sunblock.
他带了防晒霜。

1607
01:13:20.160 --> 01:13:21.020
He's got his shoes.
他穿上了鞋。

1608
01:13:21.220 --> 01:13:23.240
He probably has a little bag he takes to work.
他大概还有个带去上班的小包。

1609
01:13:23.620 --> 01:13:28.160
Clearly, Hank knows how much Dwight loves a stroll and how he's been looking for a stroll buddy.
很显然，汉克知道德怀特有多喜欢散步，也知道他一直在找个散步搭子。

1610
01:13:28.400 --> 01:13:29.340
I love it.
我太喜欢了。

1611
01:13:30.560 --> 01:13:31.520
I love it.
我太喜欢了。

1612
01:13:31.540 --> 01:13:31.760
I know.
就是说啊。

1613
01:13:31.880 --> 01:13:32.440
It tickled me.
这把我逗乐了。

1614
01:13:32.920 --> 01:13:35.520
Well, this stroll is not going to convince Dwight.
不过，这次散步可说服不了德怀特。

1615
01:13:35.880 --> 01:13:38.340
Dwight says, I am not going to fall on my sword for you.
德怀特说，我才不会为你两肋插刀呢。

1616
01:13:38.420 --> 01:13:39.360
It's not going to happen.
没门。

1617
01:13:39.720 --> 01:13:40.800
He's done it before.
他以前干过这事。

1618
01:13:41.060 --> 01:13:42.940
He's fallen on his sword and it wasn't pleasant.
他曾经为别人两肋插刀，那滋味可不好受。

1619
01:13:42.980 --> 01:13:43.780
It wasn't.
确实不好受。

1620
01:13:44.040 --> 01:13:45.980
Michael makes a pretty big speech to Dwight.
迈克尔对德怀特发表了一番长篇大论。

1621
01:13:46.080 --> 01:13:48.180
He's like, listen, why would you want to stay here?
他说，听着，你为什么还想留在这儿？

1622
01:13:48.320 --> 01:13:48.580
Yeah.
就是啊。

1623
01:13:48.840 --> 01:13:49.660
You're cooped up.
你整天被关在里面。

1624
01:13:49.740 --> 01:13:51.720
You're not even dating Angela anymore.
你甚至都不和安吉拉约会了。

1625
01:13:51.920 --> 01:13:52.980
You have a whole farm.
你可有一整座农场呢。

1626
01:13:53.240 --> 01:13:53.640
Yeah.
没错。

1627
01:13:54.280 --> 01:13:58.400
And he says, you know, on the other hand, I would be lost without Dunder Mifflin.
然后他说，你知道的，另一方面，如果没有邓德米夫林，我会迷失方向的。

1628
01:13:58.400 --> 01:14:01.560
And Dwight says, what about Shulala, Michael?
德怀特说，那鞋啦啦呢，迈克尔？

1629
01:14:03.790 --> 01:14:06.530
This is a Mindy Kaling thing, for sure.
这绝对是敏迪·卡灵的手笔。

1630
01:14:06.770 --> 01:14:09.010
This has Mindy Kaling written all over it.
这简直带有浓厚的敏迪·卡灵风格。

1631
01:14:09.150 --> 01:14:13.530
And then Michael has a talking head where he says, I have an idea for a fancy men's shoe
然后迈克尔有一段单独访谈，他说，我有个开一家高级男鞋

1632
01:14:13.530 --> 01:14:14.610
store called Shulala.
店的想法，名字叫鞋啦啦。

1633
01:14:14.870 --> 01:14:19.550
And it's just men's shoes for the special occasions in a man's life, like the day that
那是一家专门卖男士鞋履的店，只为男人一生中的特殊场合而开，比如你

1634
01:14:19.550 --> 01:14:24.310
you get married or the day your wife has a baby or just for lounging around the house.
结婚的日子，或者你妻子生孩子的日子，或者仅仅是为了在家闲逛。

1635
01:14:24.530 --> 01:14:24.810
Yeah.
没错。

1636
01:14:24.990 --> 01:14:30.930
Well, we got some mail from Kayla G who said, I just want to let you ladies know that Michael
好吧，我们收到了来自凯拉·G的一封邮件，她说，我只想让两位女士知道，迈克尔

1637
01:14:30.930 --> 01:14:35.170
seems to have gotten Shulala up and running in Nelson, British Columbia.
似乎已经在不列颠哥伦比亚省的纳尔逊把鞋啦啦开张营业了。

1638
01:14:35.570 --> 01:14:36.090
Oh.
哦。

1639
01:14:36.090 --> 01:14:39.370
And I looked it up and sure enough, there is a Shulala.
我查了一下，果不其然，还真有这么一家鞋啦啦。

1640
01:14:40.010 --> 01:14:45.570
According to their website, they are a boutique shoe store offering exquisite leather footwear
根据他们的网站显示，这是一家精品鞋店，提供来自世界各地的精致皮质鞋履

1641
01:14:45.570 --> 01:14:47.950
and handbags from all over the world.
和手袋。

1642
01:14:48.190 --> 01:14:52.530
They are a family run business that has been around since 1983.
他们是一家自1983年起就在经营的家族企业。

1643
01:14:53.430 --> 01:14:53.790
Hmm.
嗯。

1644
01:14:53.790 --> 01:14:59.050
Well, I want you guys to know that there is a Shulala in Lafayette, Louisiana.
好吧，我想让你们知道，在路易斯安那州的拉斐特也有一家鞋啦啦。

1645
01:15:00.010 --> 01:15:03.290
I was born.
我出生的地方。

1646
01:15:03.870 --> 01:15:04.390
Lafayette.
拉斐特。

1647
01:15:04.510 --> 01:15:05.050
And you know what?
你们知道吗？

1648
01:15:05.150 --> 01:15:07.530
I love the slogan for their shoe store.
我很喜欢他们鞋店的标语。

1649
01:15:07.530 --> 01:15:10.470
If you go on their website, it's a clothing boutique and shoes.
如果你登录他们的网站，会发现那是一家服装精品店兼鞋店。

1650
01:15:10.670 --> 01:15:14.890
But their slogan is, life is short, buy the damn shoes.
但他们的标语是：人生苦短，买下那双该死的鞋。

1651
01:15:16.710 --> 01:15:17.990
That is amazing.
太神奇了。

1652
01:15:18.310 --> 01:15:22.950
So there are two Shulalas, Michael, but none of them seem to sell men's shoes.
所以有两个舒拉拉，迈克尔，但似乎没有一家卖男鞋。

1653
01:15:22.950 --> 01:15:27.890
Oh, well, I would love nothing more for Michael to have Shulala.
哦，好吧，我再高兴不过迈克尔能拥有舒拉拉了。

1654
01:15:28.930 --> 01:15:32.530
Well, we have a great reverse talking head.
嗯，我们有一个很棒的反向访谈镜头。

1655
01:15:32.790 --> 01:15:33.870
Yes, I noticed.
是的，我注意到了。

1656
01:15:34.330 --> 01:15:39.330
So Dwight is in Michael's chair and you pull back to reveal Michael perched behind him.
所以德怀特坐在迈克尔的椅子上，然后镜头拉远，露出迈克尔蜷缩在他身后。

1657
01:15:39.710 --> 01:15:43.050
Basically, in this talking head, Michael's like, he's going to do it for me.
基本上，在这个访谈镜头里，迈克尔的意思是，他会为我做这件事。

1658
01:15:43.170 --> 01:15:43.750
He's going to do it.
他会去做的。

1659
01:15:43.850 --> 01:15:44.830
He's going to take the fall.
他会当替罪羊的。

1660
01:15:45.090 --> 01:15:46.650
And Dwight's like, no, I haven't decided.
而德怀特则说，不，我还没决定。

1661
01:15:47.210 --> 01:15:49.610
Well, folks in the office are starting to catch on.
好吧，办公室里的人开始察觉到了。

1662
01:15:49.750 --> 01:15:50.550
They get it.
他们明白了。

1663
01:15:50.690 --> 01:15:51.730
They know what Michael's doing.
他们知道迈克尔在干什么。

1664
01:15:51.730 --> 01:15:56.930
He wants Dwight to take the fall and they start gossiping about it.
他想让德怀特当替罪羊，于是他们开始八卦这件事。

1665
01:15:57.290 --> 01:16:05.230
There's a scene in the kitchen, you guys, that was deleted where Meredith, Kelly and Angela and Oscar are all being real chatty.
大家，厨房里有一场被删掉的戏，梅雷迪思、凯利、安吉拉和奥斯卡都在聊得火热。

1666
01:16:05.450 --> 01:16:10.670
And Michael walks in and overhears a bit and he's spying on them from the bathroom.
然后迈克尔走进来，无意中听到了一点，他在洗手间里偷听他们说话。

1667
01:16:10.970 --> 01:16:11.530
Let's hear it.
我们听听看。

1668
01:16:11.910 --> 01:16:12.390
Ladies.
女士们。

1669
01:16:13.630 --> 01:16:14.110
Really?
真的吗？

1670
01:16:14.850 --> 01:16:15.330
It's...
这……

1671
01:16:15.330 --> 01:16:18.050
I hope Dwight gets fired and we get a hot new guy to replace them.
我希望德怀特被解雇，然后我们能来一个性感的新帅哥来代替他们。

1672
01:16:18.290 --> 01:16:18.570
Seriously?
真的吗？

1673
01:16:18.930 --> 01:16:19.830
What if it's a hot new girl?
如果是个性感的新美女呢？

1674
01:16:20.250 --> 01:16:21.530
Oh my God, I had not thought of that.
哦天哪，我之前没想到这一点。

1675
01:16:22.030 --> 01:16:23.950
I think it's horrible what Michael is doing.
我觉得迈克尔做的事太糟糕了。

1676
01:16:24.690 --> 01:16:25.070
Really.
真的。

1677
01:16:25.390 --> 01:16:26.630
I mean, this is unacceptable.
我的意思是，这太让人无法接受了。

1678
01:16:32.740 --> 01:16:36.300
Hey, did you ever notice that our bathroom is right next to our kitchen?
